00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.400
[beep] Cassette Man: Connection terminated.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.180
(Nowhere to Run playing) I'm sorry to interrupt you, Elizabeth.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.660
