00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.380
But I'm afraid you've been misinformed."

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.680
You're not here to receive a gift.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:43.140
Nor have you been called here by the individual you assume.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:45.780
Although you have, indeed, been called.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.220
You have all been called here.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:52.700
Into a labyrinth of sounds and smells, misdirection and misfortune.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.400
A labyrinth with no exit.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.960
A maze with no prize.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.740
You don't even realize that you are trapped.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:02.080
Your lust for blood has driven you in endless circles,

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:06.920
chasing the cries of children in some unseen chamber, always seeming so near,

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.780
Yet somehow out of reach.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.660
But you will never find them.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:11.680
None of you will.

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.460
This is where your story ends.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.480
And to you, my brave volunteer,

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:20.020
Who somehow found this job listing not intended for you,

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.520
Although there was a way out planned for you,

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.020
I have a feeling that's not what you want.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.640
I have a feeling that you are...right where you want to be.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:29.660
I am remaining as well.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.160
I am nearby.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:33.460
This place will not be remembered,

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:38.940
and the memory of everything that started this can finally begin to fade away

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.700
As the agony of every tragedy should.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.280
And to you monsters trapped in the corridors,

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.300
Be still, and...give up your spirits.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.680
They don't belong to you.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.820
For most of you, I believe there is peace, and, perhaps, more,

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.040
Waiting for you after the smoke clears.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.900
Although, for one of you,

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:02.060
The darkest pit of Hell has opened to swallow you whole.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.100
So don't keep the devil waiting, old friend.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.360
My daughter, if you can hear me,

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.220
I knew you would return as well.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.020
It's in your nature to protect the innocent.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.800
I'm sorry that on that day,

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:17.420
the day you were shut out and left to die.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:22.620
No one was there to lift you up into their arms the way you lifted others into yours.

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.080
And then, what became of you.

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:28.500
I should have known you wouldn't be content to disappear.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.820
Not my daughter.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.540
I couldn't save you then.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.300
So let me save you now.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:38.360
It's time to rest, for you, and for those you have carried in your arms.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.520
This ends, for all of us.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.240
End communication.

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.420
[beep]

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.380
Mark: Oh...

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.100
[upbeat music]

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.940
Tutorial Unit: Congratulations on completing your work week!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.260
We apologize if your situation wasn't presented to you

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.980
in a completely honest fashion when you first started.
Mark: [chuckling]

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:03.420
But it was important that your intentions and actions be genuine.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:08.120
Mark: Haah!
Here at Fazbear Entertainment, we value fun, family, and food,

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.840
I bet you do.
Narrator: "but more importantly, we value our commitment to atoning for past mistakes"

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.500
"and tying up loose ends."

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:15.000
