00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.360
Uh, but that was really cool.

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.480
I got to admit, that was really, really cool.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:49.320
It was something that was different from the whole Five Nights At Freddy's experience as we know it,

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:50.760
but in a way, it fit so well.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.620
Like the-the simulator aspect of it,

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.920
the weirdness, and the funniness, like...

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:56.280
That's what it is. It's not like--

00:13:56.360 --> 00:14:02.600
These games aren't, like, solely divided into scariness and uh- uh- thrill, and like

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.120
mystery and theories,

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:05.800
it's-it's a mixture of all of it.

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:08.680
And that's what made Five Nights At Freddy's so magical in the first place,

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:12.800
is that it was a fun, satirical, dry humor,

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:15.660
and it-it-it also was extremely terrifying,

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:21.080
and it's that perfect mixture that always made Five Nights at Freddy's so wonderful.

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:22.940
And this game really captured it.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.840
Leaning more on the silliness, but

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.400
actually leaning really heavy into the darker tones of it.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:32.040
It bridged this gap really nicely, and I really enjoyed that.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.900
But before I go, I'm gonna see what happens if I hit continue

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.100
