That's not what it is.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.820
So I'm gonna leave this at this,

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:49.760
And, uh, maybe I will try to beat the other modes.

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.740
But thank you everybody so much for watching,

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.980
thank you for joining me on this journey of Five Nights at Freddy's,

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:57.940
I know that Five Nights at Freddy's will not be over in the hearts of the fans,

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:01.420
and maybe even Scott will make more Five Nights at Freddy's games in the future,

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:05.400
but as far as the main story goes, I think that is a really nice conclusion

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.360
to answer a lot of unanswered questions and get that out there.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:08.960
So.

